{"id":"d5ec722cbdd1bb04","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-ramsey-cardinal.md","title":"Ramsey Cardinal","display":"df-ramsey-cardinal — Ramsey Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ramsey-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-ramsey-cardinal"],"display":"df-ramsey-cardinal — Ramsey Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ramsey-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ramsey-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ramsey-cardinal — Ramsey Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,f,H\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,f,H\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ramsey}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ramsey}\\)</span> (Ramsey-cardinal predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset.md\">58-df-finite-subset.md</a> 的有限子集记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ramsey}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},2)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl[\n|H|=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\n\\forall s\\in[H]^n\\;(f(s)=i)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ramsey}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},2)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl[\n|H|=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\n\\forall s\\in[H]^n\\;(f(s)=i)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every measurable cardinal is Ramsey.</li>\n<li>Ramsey cardinals have strong partition properties.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\to (\\kappa)^{&lt;\\omega}_\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa \\to (\\kappa)^{&lt;\\omega}_\\lambda\\)</span> holds for Ramsey <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>They characterize certain internal consistency strength levels.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，采用 [[58-df-finite-subset.md]] 的有限子集记号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,f,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ramsey}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ramsey}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{<\\omega},2)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl[\n|H|=\\kappa\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\n\\forall s\\in[H]^n\\;(f(s)=i)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa \\to (\\kappa)^{<\\omega}_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"ceecb1c048f47ddb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-ramsey-cardinal]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1032","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-ramsey-cardinal.md|58-df-ramsey-cardinal]]（ba